      "created_at": "2015-06-04T18:38:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was playing Fanatic, DW Expat, Wraith, and Fixer against advanced Citizen Dawn in Silver Gultch.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I had almost beat her down before flipping, when a Sustain the Portal came out, killed Citizen Spring (her 5th citizen), and flipped her. &nbsp;Getting her to flip back cost me everyone but Wraith, but Wraith was completely set up at this point, so she managed to clean up the citizens, and I was one good Inventory Barrage away from victory... when another Sustain the Portal took out the two Explosive Wagons. &nbsp;And that, my friends, was that.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:47.784Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
